<reference id="AboutThisGuide-docJ9MtgWrg" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">About this Guide</title><?Pub Caret -2?><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc "><ph conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/about_doc" class="- topic/ph "/></shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><prodinfo class="- topic/prodinfo "><prodname class="- topic/prodname "><keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/niagara" class="- topic/keyword "/></prodname><vrmlist class="- topic/vrmlist "><vrm version="4.1" class="- topic/vrm "/></vrmlist></prodinfo></metadata><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">guide</indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section "><title class="- topic/title ">Product Documentation</title><p class="- topic/p "><ph conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/techdoc_set_hardware" class="- topic/ph "/></p></section><section class="- topic/section "><title class="- topic/title ">Document Content</title><p class="- topic/p ">This document  provides  instructions  on how to properly mount, wire, and power up the <ph conkeyref="host_models/nc9000" class="- topic/ph "/> controller. It covers the hardware features, required materials and tools, and option module combinations. The guide details environmental requirements, DIN rail and tab mounting procedures, RS485 and Ethernet wiring, earth grounding, and initial power-up steps, including LED status indicators for system health. It also explains how to insert or remove the microSD card for backups, initiate a controlled shutdown, and use the SHUT DOWN switch and DEBUG port for maintenance.  
This document covers the
mounting and wiring of the following products:</p><ul class="- topic/ul "><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p "><ph conkeyref="host_models/nc9000" conref="../reuse/WH_HardwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009933.dita#WHHardwareVariables-Tridium-9A32E735/nc9000" class="- topic/ph "/> (<ph conkeyref="host_models/pn9000" conref="../reuse/WH_HardwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009933.dita#WHHardwareVariables-Tridium-9A32E735/pn9000" class="- topic/ph "/>)</p></li><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p "><ph conkeyref="host_models/WPM-8000-8D4FAA22" conref="../reuse/WH_HardwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009933.dita#WHHardwareVariables-Tridium-9A32E735/WPM-8000-8D4FAA22" class="- topic/ph "/></p></li></ul><p class="- topic/p ">Refer to the <cite class="- topic/cite "><ph conkeyref="doctitles_coresw/JACE-9000InstallSGuide" class="- topic/ph "/></cite> for <keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/niagara4" conref="../reuse/WH_SoftwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009934.dita#WHSoftwareVariablesTridium-9A3264AE/niagara4" class="- topic/keyword "/> software installation and configuration details.</p></section></refbody></reference>